  "prefLabel": "Env-A 911.05 Semiannual Reporting of Permit Deviations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 911.05 Semiannual Reporting of Permit Deviations. The owner or operator of a stationary source, area source, or device that is subject to Env-A 609 shall report to the department, by July 31 for the period January 1 through June 30 and by January 31 for the period July 1 through December 31, the following information:\n\n(a) A summary of all permit deviations previously reported to the department pursuant to Env-A 911.04(a), (b), and (d); and\n\n(b) A list of all permit deviations recorded pursuant to Env-A 911.03(b).\n\nSource. #6983-B, eff 4-23-99; ss by #8872, eff 4-21-07; ss by #10892, eff 7-18-15; ss by #14374, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
